    <briefdescription>
<para>Byte stream of .debug_loc entries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores a unified stream of .debug_loc entries. There&apos;s <emphasis><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_debug_loc_stream_1_1_list" kindref="compound">List</ref></emphasis> for each variable/inlined-at pair, and an <emphasis><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_debug_loc_stream_1_1_entry" kindref="compound">Entry</ref></emphasis> for each <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc_entry" kindref="compound">DebugLocEntry</ref></emphasis>.</para>
<para>FIXME: Do we need all these temp symbols? FIXME: Why not output directly to the output stream? </para>
